@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Create Employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json


{
  "empNumber": "EMP001",
  "firstName": "Asheef",
  "lastName": "Ahmed",
  "department": 1,
  "status": 1,
  "gender": 1,
  "employeeType": 1,
  "reportingTo": 2,
  "email": "asheef.ahmed@example.com"
}

### Get Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1